Inline `code`, then a block:

```js
export default { port: 8080, env: { LOG_LEVEL: "info" } };
```

With a title, a highlighted line, and a change:

```js title="vite.config.js" {4} showLineNumbers
import { svelte } from "@sveltejs/vite-plugin-svelte";

export default {
  plugins: [svelte({ preprocess: [markdown()] })],
  server: { port: 8080 }, // [!code --]
  server: { port: 5173 }, // [!code ++]
};
```

```sh
$ bun run build
✓ built in 1.2s
```

A fold and a diff:

```js showLineNumbers collapse={2-4}
import { svelte } from "@sveltejs/vite-plugin-svelte";
import { markdown } from "carbon-preprocess-svelte";
import { optimizeImports } from "carbon-preprocess-svelte";
import path from "node:path";

export default { plugins: [svelte()] };
```

